跑。NOR"}}},caozuoName4="交谈",buttonShow4=0,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={{type="gaintab",args={"39005",7}},{type="doc",args={"YEL乔宁心：少侠，你要知道你救不了所有人，有些人最好的结局就是解脱。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL乔宁心：这两个孩子来得不久，还有的救，明日就是灵蛇祭，所有人都会去，但少侠可以选择不去，这是唯一的机会，再等一个月这两个孩子也救不了了。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL乔宁心：明日祭祀上我想办法拖住他们，少侠你趁此机会带这两孩子走，虽说洪水还没消退，但乘船问题不大，我在淤泥滩边留了船，少侠……一定要抓紧机会。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={4,0}},{type="showbutton",args={5,1}}},caozuoName5="交谈",buttonShow5=0,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={{type="redoc",args={"YEL乔宁心：他们逼死老村长的时候，我没有出声……后来他们做的种种我都没有出声。我太懦弱了，我如今承受的一切都是我该受的惩罚。NOR","YEL乔宁心：明日，这两个孩子的性命就全全寄托在少侠身上了。NOR"}}},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"39005",6}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0947","hdroom0948"}}}},autoResult1={{type="objectFollow",args={}},{type="showbutton",args={2,0}},{type="showbutton",args={3,1}}},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="equaltab",args={"39005",6}},{type="inroom",args={"hdroom0948","hdroom0949"}}}},autoResult2={{type="objectFollow",args={}},{type="showbutton",args={3,0}},{type="showbutton",args={4,1}}},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},rwnpc05={id="rwnpc05",baseId="rwnpc10",combatid={1,1001},name="苏红梅",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="gaintab",args={"39005",11}},{type="gaintab",args={"39008",1}},{type="doc",args={"CYN你思索一番，将今日所获和乔宁心的计划告知苏红梅。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏红梅：乔宁心说的没错，若是错过了明天，那两个孩子将再无生机。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏红梅：少侠可要抓紧机会，我也会在祭祀上相帮一二，我对祁康安有着极重要的作用，他不会对我如何，少侠放心吧。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL苏红梅：我们的合作依然成立，救人的时机千载难逢，杀人却是随时可杀，我再多等一时又何妨？少侠明日可定要成功。NOR"}},{type="delayer",args={1,"少侠，稍安勿躁！"}},{type="outgame",args={"hdrole0905"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="redoc",args={"YEL苏红梅：祁康安……我初见他时，他被仇家追杀，奄奄一息。我父亲救了他，他却恩将仇报！他看中我与蛇亲，拿我炼药，囚禁了我的妹妹控制我。NOR","YEL苏红梅：当年那场将三河村逼成荒村的瘟疫，就是出自他的手笔！还叫我让白蛇衔药下山，叫我假扮山神……什么灵丹妙药，不过透人气血的毒药，为的不就是敛财。NOR","YEL苏红梅：我当这个傀儡够久了，我都快分不清，我究竟是妖神苏红梅还是医女红梅。NOR"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},bsnpc01={id="bsnpc01",baseId="bsnpc05",combatid={1,1001},name="苏长荣",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="交谈",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL苏长荣：不、不了，马上就是灵蛇祭了，很快就有灵蛇丹了，少侠的那份就自己留着吧。NOR"}}},buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relati